QuestGuidance.Register("en",454,{
[14497]="7006BEFF\n1\tCollect spider ichor (total: 5)\030Gather spider silk (total: 6)\tAsilimu has asked you to gather ichor and silk from the spiders in Ushbarab.\n2\tReturn to Asilimu\tBring the spider ichor and spider silk back to Asilimu near Ushbarab\n",
[14498]="7000329B\n1\tReturn to Laergil\030Collect spinnerets from spiders at Haudh Lin (total: 8)\tTalath Ondren is east of the Grimwater. Defeat the spiders there and collect their spinnerets. Laergil has asked you to slay the spiders infesting Talath Ondren to collect their spinnerets. This will help her find out where the fiendish things derive their strength.\n",
[14499]="70032BD5\n1\tDefeat the draug Beremud and his minions\030Defeat the Great Spider Dígelir\tDefeat the lieutenants of the Dark Lord in the Scuttledells.\n",
[14500]="70032BD6\n1\tDefeat the draug Beremud and his minions\030Defeat the Great Spider Dígelir\tDefeat the lieutenants of the Dark Lord in the Scuttledells.\n",
[14501]="70057EC6\n1\tCollect wedding supply crates (total: 5)\tWedding supply crates can be found on the Third Circle of Minas Tirith. The wedding planner has asked you to retrieve wayward supply crates needed for her events.\n2\tDeliver the crates to Merilien\tMerilien is located on the Seventh Circle of Minas Tirith. You should bring the wedding supply crates to Merilien.\n",
[14502]="700662D2\n1\tPull invasive weeds (total: 8)\tBreniriel has asked you to pull any invasive weeds you find in Edhellond.\n2\tTalk to Breniriel\tYou have pulled all the weeds you could find. You should talk to Breniriel in Edhellond.\n",
[14503]="70025A4B\n1\tCollect piles of soggy weeds from sand-lurkers (total: 8)\tSand-lurkers can be found in the Barandalf, south of the colossus. Herthdúr asked you to search sand-lurkers in the Barandalf for piles of soggy weeds.\n2\tBring the weeds to Herthdúr\tHerthdúr is at the colossus, north of the Barandalf. Herthdúr will be eager to begin making poultices from the weeds you collected.\n",
[14504]="7004AC62\n1\tComplete Allegiance quests in Agarnaith (total: 5)\030Complete Allegiance quests in Dor Amarth (total: 5)\030Complete Allegiance quests in Lhingris (total: 5)\030Complete Allegiance quests in Talath Úrui (total: 5)\030Complete Allegiance quests in Udûn (total: 5)\tAllegiance quests can be found on Bounty Boards in Gorgoroth and Allegiance Halls. You should complete five Allegiance quests in each Region of Gorgoroth.\n2\tTalk to your Expedition Organizer\tExpedition Organizers can be found in Allegiance Halls. You should talk to your Expedition Organizer.\n",
[14505]="7004C261\n1\tComplete Court of Seregost\030Complete Dungeons of Naerband\030Complete Court of Seregost - Tier 2\030Complete Dungeons of Naerband - Tier 2\tGroup instances can be entered through the Instance Finder. You should complete group instances in Gorgoroth.\n2\tTalk to your Expedition Organizer\tExpedition Organizers can be found in Allegiance Halls. You should talk to your Expedition Organizer.\n",
[14506]="7004AC5E\n1\tComplete Bhol Rûdh: Siege of Corruption\030Complete Barad-dûr: Realm of the Black Word\030Complete Kála-murg: The Final Stand\030Complete The Burning Mountain: Blood Wings\030Complete Durthang: The Dark Spire\tResource instance quests are given by Candúr, who can be found in Udûn. You should complete each resource instance.\n2\tTalk to your Expedition Organizer\tExpedition Organizers can be found in Allegiance Halls. You should talk to your Expedition Organizer.\n",
[14507]="7004AC61\n1\tComplete Rotwing, Scourge of Dor Amarth\030Complete Uiliúr, the Ancient Evil\030Complete Spitpyre, Scourge of Talath Úrui\030Complete Gristlebite, Scourge of Lhingris\030Complete Bolvág the Cursed, Scourge of Agarnaith\030Complete Nuzdum, Scourge of Udûn\tScourges can be found throughout Gorgoroth. You should defeat each scourge in Gorgoroth.\n2\tTalk to your Expedition Organizer\tExpedition Organizers can be found in Allegiance Halls. You should talk to your Expedition Organizer.\n",
[14508]="70062DCC\n1\tCollect weekly meat orders from outside houses in Clegur (total: 8)\tThe weekly meat orders for Cunedda Moltgig can be found outside the homes of his neighbours in the village of Clegur.\n2\tBring the weekly meat orders to Cunedda Moltgig in his shop\tCunedda Moltgig is inside his shop in the village of Clegur.\n3\tTalk to Mayor Malmadog Torlan in Clegur\tMayor Malmadog Torlan is outside his house in the south of Clegur.\n4\tTalk to Cunedda Moltgig in his shop\tCunedda Moltgig is inside his shop in the village of Clegur.\n",
[14509]="7006BEAE\n1\tComplete a battle-altering quest in the Ettenmoors ([see journal]/5)\030Complete a kill enemy quest in the Ettenmoors ([see journal]/10)\030Complete a support quest in the Ettenmoors ([see journal]/20)\tFighting in the Ettenmoors and completing the requests here will earn you greater rewards. There are a series of important objectives found throughout the Ettenmoors that must be undertaken.\n",
[14510]="700647F4\n1\tComplete battle-altering Ettenmoors quests ([see journal]/5)\030Complete a kill enemy quest in the Ettenmoors ([see journal]/10)\030Complete a support quest in the Ettenmoors ([see journal]/20)\tFighting in the Ettenmoors and completing the requests here will earn you greater rewards. There are a series of important objectives found throughout the Ettenmoors that must be undertaken.\n",
[14511]="700647F3\n1\tComplete battle-altering Ettenmoors quests ([see journal]/5)\030Complete a kill enemy Ettenmoors ([see journal]/10)\030Complete a support quest in the Ettenmoors ([see journal]/21)\tFighting in the Ettenmoors and completing the requests here will earn you greater rewards. There are a series of important objectives found throughout the Ettenmoors that must be undertaken.\n",
[14512]="70072E0F\n1\tDefeat the curse on Kighân: Bloodtooth\tDefeat the Roving Threat and the scouts of Mûr Ghala will afford you commendations for your efforts.\n",
[14513]="70072E15\n1\tDefeat the malevolence of Idagâl: Imtushâl the Gall-spitter\tDefeat the Roving Threat and the scouts of Mûr Ghala will afford you commendations for your efforts.\n",
[14514]="70072E0E\n1\tDefeat the scourge of Adagím: Agáthar the Bereft\tDefeat the Roving Threat and the scouts of Mûr Ghala will afford you commendations for your efforts.\n",
[14515]="70072E16\n1\tDefeat the terror of An Shêru: Daithor\tDefeat the Roving Threat and the scouts of Mûr Ghala will afford you commendations for your efforts.\n",
[14516]="70067C65\n1\tTalk to Ithurga, the Grey Rogue\tIthurga is outside his home atop the hill in Halrax. After arriving in Halrax on the isle of Zamarzîr, a freebooter instructed you to speak with Ithurga, the Grey Rogue.\n",
[14517]="7002FEE4\n1\tMeet Cíllan at the Mead Hall for an audience with Harding\tCaptain Agelmund is eager to take you for another meeting with the Thane of Harwick, Reeve of the Wold and Aldor of the Eastemnet. You should speak with Captain Agelmund to travel to Harwick for a meeting with Harding.\n2\tTalk to Harding\tHarding has called a meeting in the Mead Hall of Harwick, and awaits your arrival.\n",
[14518]="70030693\n1\tLocate Hytbold's Mead Hall\030Locate Hytbold's Wold District\030Locate Hytbold's Sutcrofts District\030Locate Hytbold's Norcrofts District\030Locate Hytbold's Entwash District\030Locate Hytbold's Smithy\030Locate Hytbold's Study\030Locate Hytbold's Lumbermill\030Locate Hytbold's Farms\tThe various sections of Hytbold are spread throughout the ruined town. Edgal has asked you to take a quick look around the burned-out town of Hytbold.\n2\tTalk to Edgal\tEdgal is waiting at the Mead Hall in Hytbold. You should return to Edgal and speak to him about beginning the repairs.\n",
[14519]="7006B672\n1\tIntroduce yourself to Girhâzi\tIridír is along the north bank of the Ikorbân River in Ambarûl. You should go there and meet Girhâzi.\n",
[14520]="700571DD\n1\tLyndelby is hidden in the mountains west of Misthallow. You should explore Lyndelby and see if any of the Holbytlan will greet you.\t\n2\tTalk to Madelgard Túcca in Lyndelby\tLyndelby is hidden in the mountains west of Misthallow. You should explore Lyndelby and see if any of the Holbytlan will greet you.\n3\tTalk to Madelgard Túcca in Lyndelby\tLyndelby is hidden in the mountains west of Misthallow. You should talk to Madelgard Túcca in Lyndelby.\n4\tDefeat snooping goblins for Maddy (total: 4)\tGoblin snoopers can be found near Lyndelby. You should defeat the goblin snoopers for Madelgard Túcca.\n5\tTalk to Madelgard Túcca in Lyndelby\tLyndelby is hidden in the mountains west of Misthallow. You should talk to Madelgard Túcca in Lyndelby.\n6\tMeet Heldric Túcca\tHeldric Túcca can be found in Lyndelby. You should meet with Heldric Túcca.\n7\tMeet Ogiva Túcca\tOgiva Túcca can be found in Lyndelby. You should meet with Ogiva Túcca.\n8\tMeet with Vilihad Túcca\tVilihad Túcca can be found in Lyndelby. You should meet with Vilihad Túcca.\n9\tMeet with Valaric Túcca\tValaric Túcca can be found in Lyndelby. You should meet with Valaric Túcca.\n10\tMeet with Odger Túcca\tOdger Túcca can be found in Lyndelby. You should meet with Odger Túcca.\n11\tMeet with Erma Túcca\tErma Túcca can be found in Lyndelby. You should meet with Erma Túcca.\n12\tMeet with Ubbo Bolga\tUbbo Bolga can be found in Lyndelby. You should meet with Ubbo Bolga.\n13\tMeet with Gísla Bolga\tGísla Bolga can be found in Lyndelby. You should meet with Gísla Bolga.\n14\tMeet with Badehild Bolga\tBadehild Bolga can be found in Lyndelby. You should meet with Badehild Bolga.\n15\tMeet with Fastrada Túcca\tFastrada Túcca can be found in Lyndelby. You should meet with Fastrada Túcca.\n16\tMeet with Clodar Túcca\tClodar Túcca can be found in Lyndelby. You should meet with Clodar Túcca.\n17\tMeet with Húbald Túcca\tHúbald Túcca can be found in Lyndelby. You should meet with Húbald Túcca.\n18\tTalk to Madelgard Túcca in Lyndelby\tMadelgard Túcca can be found in Lyndelby. You should talk to Madelgard Túcca.\n",
[14521]="70017BCF\n1\tAssist Gamli\030Assist Ráthulf\030Assist Athils\tGamli and Ráthulf are in Durin's Threshold. Athils is in the North Wing of Durin's Threshold: up the stairs, to the north, and then west. Thormóth has asked you to speak with some of the dwarves who are having difficulty in settling Durin's Threshold.\n2\tSpeak with Thormóth\tThormóth is in Durin's Threshold. Having lent a helping hand at this first expedition site, you should now return to its leader.\n",
[14522]="70049124\n1\tBlack goats and sûlokil can be found sparsely populating the plains and hills of Dor Amarth. You should gather meats from these beasts to help feed the conquest into Mordor.\t\n2\tGather meats (total: 10)\tBlack goats and sûlokil can be found sparsely populating the plains and hills of Dor Amarth. You should gather meats from these beasts to help feed the conquest into Mordor.\n3\tCollect cuts of cooked meat (total: 10)\030Cook raw meat (quantity: see journal)\tYou should cook the raw meat at one of the burning fires nearby the Ruins of Díngarth.\n4\tStore the cooked meats for Ingold\tYou should bring the cooked meats back to the Ruins of Díngarth and store them away.\n5\tTalk to Ingold\tIngold can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth. You should speak with Ingold.\n",
[14523]="7000B0DF\n1\tBring the well-kept mathom to Eustoma Muddybanks\030Collect a well-kept mathom\tEustoma Muddybanks is in the Mathom House in Michel Delving in the Shire. Eustoma Muddybanks has asked you bring her some well-kept mathoms. Well-kept Mathoms drop off of Men, Dwarves, Orc-kind, Troll-kind, and the Dead of level 35 - 45 throughout the world.\n",
[14524]="70007B49\n1\tTalk to Northrim at Dol Vaeg\tNorthrim is at the Eglan-encampment at Dol Vaeg overlooking Haragmar and Nan Dhelu. Stanric sent you to Northrim to complete further tasks necessary to prepare the Eglain for the grim future ahead of them.\n2\tBring the boar-stomachs and haunches to Northrim at Dol Vaeg\030Collect boar-meat (total: 6)\030Collect boar-stomach (total: 6)\tBoars may be found eastwards along the Great East Road, which lies to the south of Ost Guruth. Northrim dispatched you to collect boar-haunches and stomachs to help the Eglain fill their winter stores.\n",
[14525]="7002C329\n1\tBurn Nink-hai supplies (quantity: see journal)\tThe Nink-hai Orc-tribe can be found south-west of Odda's tent. Odda has given you a torch which can be used to set fire to the supply-stores of the Orcs.\n2\tTalk to Odda at his tent\tOdda can be found near the road south of the Cuthstan. The Orcs' supply-stores have been destroyed by your actions, and Odda is awaiting news of your success.\n",
[14526]="7004119F\n1\tSpeak with Ransroth\tTalk to Ransroth\n",
